***********************************************************
*
* BAV199
*
* Nexperia
*
* Low-leakage double diode
* IFmax = 160mA
* VRmax = 75V
* VFmax = 1,25V  @ IF = 150mA
* IRmax = 5nA    @ VR = 75V
*
* Package: SOT23
* Package Pin 1: Anode   D1
* Package Pin 2: Cathode D2
* Package Pin 3: Cathode D1; Anode D2
*
* Simulator: PSPICE (original), used here in LTspice
*
* Two ways to use this file (add .lib BAV199.lib to the schematic):
*  1. Single diode: standard diode symbol, set its Value to BAV199.
*  2. Whole package: symbol BAV199_DUAL.asy (subcircuit below,
*     pins in package order 1 2 3).
*
***********************************************************
*
.MODEL BAV199 D
+ IS=805.84E-18
+ N=1.0246
+ RS=50.000E-3
+ IKF=362.16E-6
+ CJO=1.9002E-12
+ M=.35193
+ VJ=1.2722
+ ISR=298.95E-15
+ BV=113.30
+ IBV=10
+ TT=1.0230E-6
*
* Dual diode as in the SOT23 package: pin1 = A1, pin2 = K2, pin3 = K1/A2
.SUBCKT BAV199_DUAL 1 2 3
D1 1 3 BAV199
D2 3 2 BAV199
.ENDS BAV199_DUAL
*
